{"candidateAnswer":"Various creative and outdoor hobbies","evidence":"[D5:4 | 1:36 pm on 3 July, 2023] Melanie: Wow, Caroline! That's great! I just signed up for a pottery class yesterday. It's like therapy for me, letting me express myself and get creative. Have you found any activities that make you feel the same way?\n[D9:1 | 2:31 pm on 17 July, 2023] Melanie: Hey Caroline, hope all's good! I had a quiet weekend after we went camping with my fam two weekends ago. It was great to unplug and hang with the kids. What've you been up to? Anything fun over the weekend?\n[D1:12 | 1:56 pm on 8 May, 2023] Melanie: You'd be a great counselor! Your empathy and understanding will really help the people you work with. By the way, take a look at this.\n[D1:18 | 1:56 pm on 8 May, 2023] Melanie: Yep, Caroline. Taking care of ourselves is vital. I'm off to go swimming with the kids. Talk to you soon!","itemId":"urn:uuid:bbc89fff-1510-5a8e-a9cd-c83f18bf6d5f","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:6041bdb7e1e214152d2f08393805ea7525eddcd50182b1d4791c9c315bb86b3d","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What activities does Melanie partake in?","referenceAnswer":"pottery, camping, painting, swimming","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"6041bdb7e1e214152d2f08393805ea7525eddcd50182b1d4791c9c315bb86b3d"}}]}